Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.67,0:00:04.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就从没被迫遵守过别人的规则吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you never had to play by anybody else's rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你就是个被惯坏的小孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you're just a spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女人一般不会这么跟我说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Women don't usually talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，因为你魅力无法挡嘛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, because you're so devastatingly attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有这口音，对。哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the accent, yeah. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以这是圈套，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this is a setup,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我就是那个又老又饥渴的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm the old, desperate one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出事了，是玛丽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something's wrong. It's Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.82,0:00:18.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-跟我来。  -玛丽！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come with me.   -Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.39,0:00:20.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们杀人了，对吧？  -是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We killed somebody, didn't we?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有约翰·布斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there is John Booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是刚买下我们电视台的那个人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The guy that just bought our network?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:25.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里所有人都知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone here knows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》真正的创作者是你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you're the true creator of "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以就是你在叫我“性感瑞秋”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you're the one who's calling me "Hot Rachel."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你确实有点像她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you do kind of look like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个自私的贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a selfish bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被解雇了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.57,0:00:40.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到目前为止，你害我撞上硬膜外麻醉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So far, you've run me into an epidural,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:42.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开除我表妹，还有某个姑娘的爸爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}firing my cousin, and some girl's daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:45.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，这是我的工作，我每个该死的日子都在做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, this is my job, and I do it every stupid day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这该死的每一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of my stupid life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:48.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静点，好吗？你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Calm down, all right? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:50.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不知道！  -你有按时吃药吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't know!   -Are you taking your meds?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:52.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在被诊断的是什么来着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What am I prescribed for right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}边缘型还是自恋型人格障碍？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Borderline or narcissistic personality disorder?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我老是搞混。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I'm like constantly getting them confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.19,0:00:58.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我觉得瑞秋爱上那家伙了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I think Rachel's in love with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:00.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没见过她这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've never seen her like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我见过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:04.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那小子就像癌症，我们得把他切掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That boy's like a cancer. We need to cut him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:06.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你好啊，美女。  -格温？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hello, gorgeous.   -Gwen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在在干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，有这么件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, there's this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.15,0:01:24.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我表妹下个月要在玛莎葡萄园岛结婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My cousin's getting married on Martha's Vineyard next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:25.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你表妹要结婚了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your cousin's getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，不过我在想……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She is, but I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.79,0:01:29.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿不愿意当我的伴，陪我参加婚礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you'll be my date to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.49,0:01:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:37.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那绝对会是场噩梦，不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be a total nightmare, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.90,0:01:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-婚礼之后……  -嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-after the wedding...   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以去待几天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can go spend a couple days
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.83,0:01:42.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我家奇尔马克的房子里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at my family's house in Chilmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:44.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，说定了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.74,0:01:46.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是要我求你吗？愿意！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want me to beg you or what? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.61,0:01:49.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意。不，我说的不是愿意被你求。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. No, not yes to the beg.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:51.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是，愿意，我很想去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just, yes, I'd love to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.64,0:01:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:01:59.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊，走开！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.29,0:02:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我真的真的觉得你该出来一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I really, really think you should come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.59,0:02:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么事，麦迪逊？  -对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, Madison?   -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这儿有个人你肯定想见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's someone here that you're gonna want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:08.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谁？  -呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who?   -Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:24.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？滚出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing? Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那么，呃，我都没回你电话，这其中的哪一点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, um, what part about me not returning your calls
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:36.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你觉得我想让你出现\N{\rEN\blur0.8}made you think I wanted you to show up here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.49,0:02:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在大半夜？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-奎因打电话给我的。  -她打了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Quinn called me.   -She did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.49,0:02:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我来上节目的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm here to do the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:43.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}某种旧情人回归、寻求救赎那种戏码？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some kind of ex-suitor returns, seeks redemption kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想从《永恒》那里求救赎？不，我没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want redemption from "Everlasting"? No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:47.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我愿意忍受《永恒》\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'm willing to put up with "Everlasting"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.94,0:02:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我想见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，老兄，你已经见到我了。走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, dude, you've seen me. Like, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:53.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.91,0:02:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我搞砸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不敢相信我搞砸得有多糟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe how badly I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:58.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不该听奎因的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I shouldn't have listened to Quinn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.98,0:03:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不该逃走的，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I shouldn't have run away and I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我变了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.65,0:03:05.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过去这几个月，我一直在非洲做慈善。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These past few months, I've been in Africa doing charity work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.39,0:03:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去了非洲，像我那个非洲？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were in Africa, like my Africa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是，我去了那儿，走遍各个村庄\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, I went there and I traveled through villages
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:12.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}帮他们获得干净的水，太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}helping them gain access to clean water, and it was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.26,0:03:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我想让你和我一起，我试着打过电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was... I wanted you there with me, and I tried calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没回你电话。你还不明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did not call you back. Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟你房里那个人有关吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this about whoever's in that room with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:20.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你我都清楚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because you and I both know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.83,0:03:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管他是谁，他都不重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}whoever he is, he doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不知道自己在说什么，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have no idea what you're talking about, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:28.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早上回来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be back in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我的航班要到周四。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but my flight's not till Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.71,0:03:32.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会去别处的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:37.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:38.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，他是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果奎因打给他的，为什么他第一站\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If Quinn called him, why is his first stop
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是大半夜你的办公室？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}your office in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这问题问得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a really good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，是因为我们有这么一段，挺疯的事。一段事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, it's because we have this, like, whole crazy thing. A thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:52.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像斯德哥尔摩综合征那种，你知道的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was like this Stockholm syndrome thing, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:55.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是他们……你基本上是在“制作”他们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}where they're like... you're, like, basically producing them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:57.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后他们就会爱上你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then they, like, fall in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:04:00.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是尽量忘记这一切发生过，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just try to forget that it ever happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……真的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which... really...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哇。  -是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wow.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:10.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就把他踢掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So let's get rid of him.
