Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:28.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，又来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:31.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦！  -天哪，那屁股真让人想咬一口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ooh!   -Damn, that ass is bite-able.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:34.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}屁股。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Booty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.02,0:08:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}身材真不错。抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is a nice package. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-确实。  -那能一只手抓住吗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Word.   -Can you fit that in one hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是需要两只手？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or do you need two hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:46.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是好奇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:48.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看那腹肌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at those abs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-上等英国香肠。  -哇哦，哇哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Fine British sausage.   -Hubba, hubba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，是啊。不，你们想怎么羞辱都行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, yeah. No, you can throw around all the insults you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一整天都这样。也许我们都该冷静一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is like this all day. Maybe we should all just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.87,0:08:58.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为达里厄斯根本不在乎，好吗？我不知道你做了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because Darius doesn't care, okay? I don't know what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.17,0:09:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-醒醒吧。  -好了，姑娘们，姑娘们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wake up.   -Okay, guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会做出决定的，因为他想要我，好吗？姑娘们，姑娘们，姑娘们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's gonna make a decision 'cause he wants me, okay? Guys, guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:05.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这很难，但我也处在过达里厄斯的位置，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know it's hard, but I have been in Darius' shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:07.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可能有着强烈的感情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he's probably having strong feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:10.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是不知道该怎么表达。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that he's just not sure how to express.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候一个女人真的会让你受到挑战，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes a woman really challenges you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:17.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你想逃开，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it makes you want to run away,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为那太可怕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because it's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:23.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，詹姆森，他说的不是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good Lord, Jameson, he's not talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:26.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最糟的是，我确实在这里遇到了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the worst part is I did meet
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个了不起的女人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An incredible woman here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想和她共度余生，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I wanted to spend the rest of my life with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:32.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我毁了这一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从那以后我每天都在后悔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I've regretted it every day since.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只希望当初能屏蔽其他一切，跟随自己的心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wish I'd tuned everything else out and followed my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.21,0:09:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:45.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全美国的内裤都齐刷刷地湿了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the panties of America drip in unison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:48.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，瑞秋，你真该多跟嘉宾睡睡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Rachel, you should screw the talent more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-歇歇吧，奎因。  -太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Give it a rest, Quinn.   -This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.69,0:09:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，我们能不能让\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, people, how about we get
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我目前这个烦人的追求者达里厄斯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my current pain-in-the-ass suitor Darius
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.36,0:09:58.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稍微上点心？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to give a fraction of a crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，停，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, cut, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:05.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收工。明白了吗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a wrap. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:08.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得告诉你，你那一季我一分钟都没落下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to tell you, I watched every minute of your season.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是……谢谢。太激烈了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was... thank you. It was so intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:14.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得把一切都告诉我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至听到了你和瑞秋的传闻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I even heard a rumor about you and Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么这么感兴趣？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you so interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:20.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是个好奇的女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just a curious girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想那边有给你的饮料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think they have drinks for you just over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.99,0:10:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。刚才很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你看起来太美了。  -哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You looked fantastic.   -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:33.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是科尔曼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是新来的节目统筹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the new showrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:37.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-节目统筹，对。  -欢迎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Showrunner, right.   -Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，很抱歉那天晚上把瑞秋叫走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I am so sorry about pulling Rachel away the other evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望没搞砸什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope it didn't mess anything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。你搞不砸什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's fine. You can't mess anything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:44.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好。  -一切都好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay.   -It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:46.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，我们只要让观众看到你不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, let's just show the viewers you're not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:48.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那种被甩了还不肯放弃的失败者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}some loser who got dumped and won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，需要的话我可以非常有说服力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I can be very convincing when I need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:55.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我们，呃，去准备下一段吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's, uh, go get you ready for the next segment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:10:59.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-很高兴认识你。  -嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Nice to meet you.   -Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那家伙真不要脸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That guy is shameless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.39,0:11:03.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，他是个占有欲强、自以为是的大男孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm, he's a possessive, entitled man-baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一直都是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's who he's always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你们还是有过一段，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And yet you guys had a thing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.07,0:11:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我说过了，老兄，那已经，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I told you, dude, it's, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像埋在六英尺深的地下一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}buried like six feet deep somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是吗？  -是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为，你看，先是杰里米，现在又是亚当？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause, look, first, it was Jeremy, and now Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可能对片场的露水情缘没什么感情，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You might not have any feelings for your set flings,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:19.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他们显然对你念念不忘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but they certainly seem to be harboring a few for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:30.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}克伦威尔，我得跟你谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cromwell, I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你现在想加入吗？  -好了，够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do you want to jump in now?   -Okay, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没开玩笑。我没兴趣，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not even kidding. I'm not interested, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以别在镜头前说那些模棱两可的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So stop with the double talk on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再试图追我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop trying to woo me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者你干脆承认你想我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or you could just admit that you miss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，别自作多情了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, get over yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:42.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你知道我们曾经拥有过什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you know what we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我们拥有过的是个错误。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, what we had was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是想告诉我，我们之间什么都不算？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you trying to tell me that what we had was nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:12:00.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没爱过你，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never loved you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:02.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从来没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.79,0:12:07.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从来没真心爱过我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You never loved loved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没爱过你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:21.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:25.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哦，要把我埋葬\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Ooh, gonna bury me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:39.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:42.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以别来烦我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:45.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 继续让它们往下灌，让它们淹没 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Keep 'em goin' down now, let 'em drown *
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:48.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 埋葬它们，埋葬它们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Bury 'em down, bury 'em down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因，你……拜托，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, are... Come on, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:57.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我给你点时间。  -为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'll give you a minute.   -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怕我的内裤？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You afraid of my undies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉上拉链。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Zip it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:09.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以看来我得感谢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So I guess I have you to thank
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.32,0:13:11.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让布斯主动联系我，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for Booth reaching out to me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不，都是他的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, it was all his doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果电视台\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turns out the network
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的很爱他们的小神童。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}really loves their little boy wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:19.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我是说你让他把瑞秋踢出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm saying you told him to cut Rachel out.
