Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:23.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我那么做是为了布斯，其实也是为了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did that for Booth's sake, and yours, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:26.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，你可真体贴，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, that was so thoughtful of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但实际上瑞秋很擅长她的工作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but actually it turns out Rachel's great at her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:30.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯，我知道。  -哦，看吧，我知道你知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah, I know.   -Oh, see, I know you know.
