Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样她就不会去别处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so she won't go anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，让她有动力的东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, the thing that makes her tick
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.05,0:13:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也会让炸弹爆炸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}also makes bombs explode
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:39.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且在她身边频繁得吓人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with startling frequency around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:43.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，向电视台告状、跟去年的追求者上床，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, tattling to the network, screwing last year's suitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:45.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有和杰里米这一整摊烂事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this whole ugly mess with Jeremy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:48.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那其实不是她的错！绝对不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was not her fault, actually! Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她真的没能力处理事情\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But she's not really capable of managing things
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:54.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像我们其他人一样应付日常。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on a day-to-day basis like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这儿管着她，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I keep her in line here, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.27,0:14:02.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你真想全天候拆弹吗，嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, do you really want to be on a full-time bomb squad, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋没事，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel's fine, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果她最大的问题是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Turns out her big problem is working
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:14.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给一个控制狂、爱操纵人的婊子干活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for a controlling, manipulative, bitch.
