Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.07,0:14:36.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对彼此了解得那么深，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so well over the past few weeks and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是警察，所以大家不一定知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a cop, so people don't always know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:41.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能有多热情、多性感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}how passionate and sexy I can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}熊熊炉火，一瓶红酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Roaring fire, bottle of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:49.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来要跟未婚夫去威尼斯的，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was supposed to go to Venice with my fiancé, but...
