Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，这小子这样已经有一阵了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, homeboy's been like that for a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你还没注意到的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in case you haven't noticed.
