Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:21.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，兄弟，给你个建议，我也经历过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, just a word of advice, mate, having been where
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在的处境……选那个未婚夫死了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you are... pick the one with the dead fiancé.
