Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，我的天。  -嘿，我能……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, my God.   -Hey, can I...
