Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:29.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都好吗？你为什么要回到这个蛇窝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything all right? Why would you come back here to this snake pit?
