Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:40.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不在乎香黛尔。要我给你发颗金星吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care about Chantal. You want a gold star?
