Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:20.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，五分钟后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.74,0:17:27.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}古怪至极。我喜欢。我喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Completely eccentric. I love it. I love it.
