Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.81,0:17:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-John，非常感谢。  -好，幸会，幸会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-John, thank you so much.   -Yes, pleasure, pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:57.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:59.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，真是太抱歉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. I'm so sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我本来想告诉你的。  -嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I was gonna tell you.   -Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我……Quinn 当时……  -Quinn？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I... Quinn was...   -Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:04.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.52,0:18:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她……什么，她当时……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She... what, she was...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:08.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对，当然。  -想把我排挤出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah, of course.   -Trying to cut me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.19,0:18:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来打算等我说服他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wasn't gonna say anything until I convinced him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.39,0:18:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我们两个一起见面再说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to meet with both of us just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:13.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没关系。你知道吗？完全没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay. You know, what? It's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:15.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你完全可以自己跟他提案。这没什么大不了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could have just pitched him on your own. It's big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:16.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，不！  -没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, no!   -It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能。我不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't. I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.36,0:18:20.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……我们想一起做的一切，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This... everything we want to do together,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们想做的所有电视节目……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all the TV that we want to make...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是……我们是一个团队。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's... we're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:25.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哇。  -嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Whoa.   -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:28.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能稍等一下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you just hold on one second?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:38.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我一秒钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别告诉我你现在得走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't tell me you have to leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，我没有。  -你别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, I don't.   -Don't you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel Goldberg。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:54.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，哇，哇，哇，哇，哇，哇，哇！哇，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa! Whoa, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:56.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？这就是你想让我看的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? That's what you wanted me to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:58.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，哇，哇。抱歉。请你出去好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, wow, wow. I'm sorry. Do you want to get out, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:19:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.28,0:19:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说“这是你想让他看的”是什么意思？我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did he mean this is what you wanted him to see? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他一定是误解了我说的话。他误解了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He must have just misunderstood something that I'd said. He misunderstood?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:20.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，如果这里面有什么事，Rachel，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, if there's something going on here, Rachel, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，他……我向你保证他已经走了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, he's... I promise you that he's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且那里……什么事都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that there... There is nothing going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只是永远离开我们的生活了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's just out of our lives for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.47,0:19:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个人都有包袱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone has baggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我明白。我也有疯狂的前任。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I get that. I have crazy exes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他们不会凌晨三点给我打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They don't call me at 3:00 A.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:38.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更别说凌晨三点出现在我工作的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}let alone show up at my work at 3:00 A.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们大多数人会长大，会处理好这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Most of us, we grow up, and we deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:44.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得这很好玩吗？前任冒出来，还有这些闹剧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you think this is cute... The exes popping up, the drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.48,0:19:45.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不觉得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:48.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直对你那么坦诚……嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have been so honest with you... Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:51.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于一切，关于我对我们未来的所有设想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About everything, about everything I see for our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.49,0:19:53.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以请你把这事处理好，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So just deal with this, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:19:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁能把那些挪过来？我几乎不会游泳。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can someone move those over here, please? I can barley swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.87,0:20:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不上这个。不。不，你要上船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not getting on this. Yes. Yes, you are getting on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不上船。那你会给我救生衣吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm not getting on the boat. Well, are you gonna give me a life jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:06.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他不上船。  -你不需要救生衣。- 这东西……救生衣？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-He is not getting on the boat.   -You don't need a life jacket.   -This thing... life jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:07.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-交给我来处理。  -各位，这不是贡多拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Just let me handle this.   -You guys, this isn't a gondola.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.81,0:20:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是划艇。  -等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is a row boat.   -Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:11.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我在 Craigslist 上花 50 美元买了这船，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I spent $50 on this boat on Craigslist,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚它就会变成贡多拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it's gonna be a gondola by tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:15.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Madison！听着，我不想上船。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison! Look, I don't want to be going on on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Madison，Madison，看看这多不安全。很安全。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, Madison, look at how unsafe this is. It's so safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:19.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你不会开除我的。  -你在这里干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're not gonna fire me.   -What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:22.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见到你我也很高兴，Rach。Darius 打电话了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great to see you, too, Rach. Darius called.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.52,0:20:25.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他对这里的情况不太满意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not exactly happy with the way things are going here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:27.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这我不能怪他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't say I blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:31.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在笑我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You laughing at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-挺有趣的，对吧？  -对，是挺有趣。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's fun, isn't it?   -Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你戴着这个真帅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look so handsome with that on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:37.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也很美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你开玩笑吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm, are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你知道吗？  -等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You know?   -Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我有三个兄弟。  -你开玩笑吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I have three brothers.   -You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，两个，再加上 Romeo。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, well, two and then Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.71,0:20:51.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯。  -我怎么不知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hmm.   -How did I not know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:53.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们一直没\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because we haven't gotten
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:56.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}机会聊天，这不怪你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the chance to talk, and that's not on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:58.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:20:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我知道我被塑造成了这种\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I know I've been made into this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}单一的角色……死了未婚夫的女孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}one-note character... Girl with the dead fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:06.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你可能觉得我还没准备好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I know that you might think that I'm not ready
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}往前走，或者觉得我不开放，但我是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to move on or that I'm not open, but I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想向你证明这一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I want to prove that to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好。我很佩服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well done. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们给我150块，我就干这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They give me $150, and this is what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:21.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:24.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来在回酒店的路上，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was on my way back to the hotel,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我意识到我得当面看着你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I realized I had to look you in the face
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.49,0:21:30.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问你为什么还跟奎恩待在这地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and ask you why are you still here with Quinn in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:33.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能因为嫉妒就来评判我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't get to judge me just because you're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.73,0:21:35.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嫉妒？  -对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jealous?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.13,0:21:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嫉妒你拼命跟老板上床\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jealous that you're desperately banging your boss
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:38.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}指望他把你往上带\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the hopes he takes you up the ladder
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:40.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这《永恒》这个巨大的地狱洞里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the the gaping hell hole that is "Everlasting"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他远远不只是我的老板。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, he's so much more than my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:43.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他邀请我去他表亲的婚礼……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He invited me to his cousin's wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在玛莎葡萄园岛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on Martha's Vineyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.77,0:21:47.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听听你自己在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you hear yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:48.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醒醒吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方是邪恶和失常的漩涡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This place is a vortex of evil and dysfunction
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}碰到什么就把什么变成屎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}turning everything it touches to shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么就看不清？它在毁掉你的人生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you not see that? It's ruining your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:58.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你现在成了道德权威了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, what, you're some, like, moral authority now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你亲了几个艾滋病婴儿拍了拍照，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, like, kiss a few AIDS babies for some photo op,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:03.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就以为自己在替天行道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you think that you're doing God's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的在帮助别人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm actually helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真的？  -对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:08.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我，你觉得……你觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me, who do... Who do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这里到底帮了谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're actually helping here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，每周看我节目的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, the 16 million people who watch
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:13.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一千六百万观众啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my television show every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我凭一己之力打破了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I have single-handedly broken down
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有这些关于爱情和种族的成见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}all of these preconceived notions on love and race
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为科尔曼和我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because Coleman and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.17,0:22:23.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在做有意义的电视。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we are making television that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.51,0:22:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知道你有没有注意到，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know if you've noticed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.91,0:22:26.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有史上第一个黑人求偶者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we actually have the first black suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.68,0:22:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是开创性的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's groundbreaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.42,0:22:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你的黑人求偶者……  -嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Your black suitor...   -Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.52,0:22:34.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在一艘假船上、假湖里约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is on a fake date in a fake boat on a fake lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是《永恒》，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:38.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你完全是活在幻觉里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're completely delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.54,0:22:50.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要让你看到我准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm going to show you that I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.61,0:22:58.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-达瑞斯。  -嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Darius.   -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:01.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我未婚夫的骨灰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are the ashes of my fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:04.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想今晚在这里，当着你的面放他走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm want let him go here with you tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.02,0:23:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好让我的心准备好再次去爱。怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so that my heart can be ready to love again. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.95,0:23:09.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-风扇，风扇，风扇。  -等等，什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Fan, fan, fan.   -Okay, wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，把风扇拿过去。开最大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, get in there with the fan. Make it blow hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.69,0:23:13.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}骨灰……达瑞斯，我只想让你看到我准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ashes are... I just want to show you, Darius, that I'm ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:15.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，等等，你不用……你不必……天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, wait you don't... You don't have to... oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？！天哪，达瑞斯！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?! Oh, my God, Darius!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.70,0:23:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-太对不起了！  -天哪！天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm so sorry!   -Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，过来。天哪，死人进我嘴里了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, come here. Oh, my God, dead guy in my mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.50,0:23:23.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，太抱歉了，达瑞斯。好，卡，所有人，卡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, I'm so sorry, Darius. Okay, cut, everyone, cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重新来。休息二十分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's reset. Let's take 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.85,0:23:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真好。亚当回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How nice. Adam came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How does that feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.85,0:23:40.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定感觉不错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's got to feel good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.49,0:23:42.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯？  -他在为你争取。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hmm?   -He's fighting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.22,0:23:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是为你来的。是啊，没用……你的计划。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's here for you. Yeah, it didn't work... um, your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是利用亚当拆散科尔曼和我那个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, the using Adam to break up Coleman and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:53.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打算怎么办？想把我独占吗，还是你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What were you gonna do? Did you want to keep me all to yourself, or did you, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.16,0:23:55.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让我爬回你身边？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanted me to, like, come crawling back to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.17,0:23:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是什么来着？我想让你看清科尔曼的真面目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was it? I wanted to show you Coleman for who he really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:00.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道科尔曼的真面目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I know who Coleman really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是他们找来替代你的新制片人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's the new showrunner that they brought in to replace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.91,0:24:04.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你还在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And yet you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.74,0:24:06.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你有个这么好的男人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you seriously have this, like, great guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.95,0:24:08.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却把所有时间花在这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're spending all of your time here
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.88,0:24:11.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想毁掉我的人生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}trying to ruin my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.28,0:24:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得放下我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to get over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.95,0:24:15.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放下你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.82,0:24:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.99,0:24:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“不”？这什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"No"? What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.53,0:24:24.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就像是对我着迷了，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're, like, obsessed with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.06,0:24:26.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去过你自己的日子吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.30,0:24:35.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.11,0:24:36.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:37.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.91,0:24:40.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我真想去别的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'd really like to be anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.71,0:24:42.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那，呃……  -那我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Well, then, uh...   -So, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.31,0:24:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，离开这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.75,0:24:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去波斯特牧场酒店怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How about, uh, Post Ranch Inn?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.72,0:24:47.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.95,0:24:49.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像……就像他们铁了心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like... it's like they're hell-bent
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.32,0:24:50.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-要让我出丑。  -我知道，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-on making me look like a fool.   -I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.02,0:24:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我就不能有一次正常的约会吗？  -好吧，那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I can't have one normal date?   -Okay, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.72,0:24:54.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一次正常的约会？！  -那你想怎么做，达？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-One normal date?!   -So, what do you want to do, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.26,0:24:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想离开这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You trying to get up out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.33,0:24:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对，我就想离开这儿。我们走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You damn right I want to get out of here. Let's get up out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.93,0:24:59.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗯，干杯！  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mnh-mnh, cheers!   -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:01.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯，你为什么不选我？我也不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, why didn't you pick me? I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.67,0:25:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我一定是脑子进水了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I must have been out of my damn mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.27,0:25:04.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们想不想玩点刺激的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You girls want to have some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:06.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然想。那辆宾利还停在车道上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, yeah. That Bentley's still in the driveway.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.84,0:25:08.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-没错！  -走吧，来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes, it is!   -Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.21,0:25:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-走吧，来。  -快点。快点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's go, come on.   -Hurry up. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:11.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走，走。对，我喜欢你这个思路！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go. Let's go. Yes, I like where your head's at!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.01,0:25:13.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-完美。  -别摔了。 - 我没摔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Perfect.   -Don't fall.   -I'm not falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.85,0:25:15.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谢谢。  -快来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thank you.   -Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.99,0:25:21.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.72,0:25:24.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在忙什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.86,0:25:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}筛选照片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Photo kills.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.06,0:25:29.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-预算审批。  -嗯，真有意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Budget approvals.   -Hmm, fun stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.73,0:25:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，对。  -对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, yeah.   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.70,0:25:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我想告诉你，我觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, well, I wanted to tell you that I think
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.60,0:25:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对我的那些包袱说得没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you were right about all of my baggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.24,0:25:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不觉得那可爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.31,0:25:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I totally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.88,0:25:45.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好。  -好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay.   -Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确实想改变。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do want to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.85,0:25:51.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我想和你在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I want to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.28,0:25:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I, like, want to go
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.85,0:25:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}陪你参加你表亲的婚礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with you to your cousin's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.39,0:25:56.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想做出开创性的电视节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to make groundbreaking television
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.32,0:25:57.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是我们聊过的那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we've talked about together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.02,0:26:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想……我真的想和你一起做这一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want... I just really want to do it all with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.06,0:26:07.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能说点什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you please say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.17,0:26:10.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，他们把车开走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}RACHEL, THEY'RE TAKING THE CAR.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.04,0:26:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是瑞秋。怎么了，麦迪逊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go for Rachel. What's going on, Madison?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.27,0:26:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，他们把车开走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}RACHEL, THEY'RE TAKING THE CAR.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.88,0:26:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谁开走……  -哦，该死！达瑞斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who is taking...   -Oh, damn it! Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.75,0:26:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -他们在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.08,0:26:23.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等等，调出画面。  -就在那。麦迪逊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wait, pull up the feed.   -Right there. Madison?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.08,0:26:24.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要把车开走了。我拦不住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}THEY'RE GONNA TAKE IT. I CAN'T STOP THEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.78,0:26:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么可能？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.19,0:26:30.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科尔曼，我们该报警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman, we should just call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.42,0:26:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -你没看出来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.79,0:26:35.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我们想做的节目。你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the show that we want to make right here. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.19,0:26:37.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得报警。在这个镇上，两个开宾利的黑人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to call the cops. On two black guys in a Bentley in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.66,0:26:39.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那不会有好结果。  -正是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That won't end well.   -Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.90,0:26:45.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-打电话吧。  -好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Make the call.   -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.41,0:26:50.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，我想报失一辆车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, yes, I'd like to report a stolen car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.71,0:26:54.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能把C机装到一辆面包车上吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you get "C" cam in a van?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.05,0:26:56.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，麦迪逊，放下手头所有事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, Madison, drop everything right now
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.08,0:26:58.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在立刻把C机装到面包车上给我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and get "C" cam in a van for us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.39,0:27:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-达瑞斯。  -嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Darius.   -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.43,0:27:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真高兴终于出了那栋房子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so glad to be out of that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.00,0:27:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是再跟一群贱人关在一起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I had been cooped up with a bunch of bitches
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.83,0:27:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再多一分钟，我就要尖叫了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for one more minute, I was gonna scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.93,0:27:17.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦。  -天啊，不，不是说你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ooh.   -Oh, my God. No, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.27,0:27:18.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别介意。  -没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No offense.   -It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.37,0:27:22.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等等，等等。  -哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hold up, hold up.   -Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.14,0:27:23.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold on. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.01,0:27:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人要倒霉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone's getting in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.78,0:27:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，没事。  -好，冷静。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, it's fine.   -All right, stay cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.48,0:27:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静……两张达瑞斯·贝克的签名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay cool... Two Darius Beck autographs
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.92,0:27:31.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我们的警察朋友，我们就绿灯放行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for our friends in blue, and we are green.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.88,0:27:35.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我。嘿，我那份达瑞斯·贝克签名呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me. Hey, where's my Darius Beck autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.03,0:27:51.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们拦到10851，四名乘员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've got the 10851, four occupants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.20,0:27:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们正靠近车辆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're approaching the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:54.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我罩着你，宝贝。  -万一我们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I got you, baby,   -What if we get...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.18,0:27:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，警官。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, there, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.51,0:27:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请出示驾照和行驶证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}License and registration, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:01.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我是达瑞斯·贝克，职业橄榄球球员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I'm Darius Beck, pro football player.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.81,0:28:03.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个四分卫？是他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The quarterback? Is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.45,0:28:05.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是啊。  -我……我不确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.   -I can't... I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:07.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得看证件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to see some I.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.92,0:28:10.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦，天。  -哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, my.   -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.12,0:28:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，听着。这太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, look. This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.96,0:28:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我身上没带证件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I don't have my I.D. on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.76,0:28:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们收走了，在，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They took it back at the, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.20,0:28:20.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在录真人秀，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm on a reality show, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.33,0:28:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他们……  -我、我们在录《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And they...   -W-we're on "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.07,0:28:23.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对。  -我们都在录《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.   -We're all on "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.77,0:28:25.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，没手机，没钱包。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, no phone, no wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.20,0:28:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你们在录节目，摄像机在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you guys are on the show, where are the cameras?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.21,0:28:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，这不在节目里，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, this isn't part of it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.41,0:28:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是带这些女孩兜兜风。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just taking these girls out for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.48,0:28:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。好吧，但听着，我是达瑞斯·贝克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. All right, but listen, I'm Darius Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.51,0:28:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们中有一个要嫁给他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One of us is gonna marry him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.95,0:28:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-蒂芙妮。  -小姐，你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Tiffany.   -Miss, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.12,0:28:39.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，她没事。她只是喝多了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, she's fine. She's just had too much to...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.85,0:28:41.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没跟你说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.12,0:28:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你回答，小姐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna need an answer from you, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.49,0:28:44.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你还好吗？  -听着，我是认真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you okay?   -Look, I'm for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.22,0:28:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没事。她喝太多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's fine. She had too much to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他真的是达瑞斯·贝克。  -她没跟你说话！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-And he really is Darius Beck.   -She's not talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.49,0:28:48.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这辆车被报失了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This car's been reported stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.96,0:28:50.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我看不到。  -什么？ - 哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I can't see.   -What?   -Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.30,0:28:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}先生，我需要你下车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir, I need you to step out of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.13,0:28:54.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你搞错了……全搞错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have it wrong... All wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.20,0:28:55.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}立刻下车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step out of the vehicle right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.90,0:28:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派恩警官，把司机弄下车\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Officer Pyne, get the driver out of the car
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.37,0:28:59.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}控制住局面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and get the situation under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.81,0:29:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你不用配合。他们得有理由才能让你下车。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you do not have to do that. They have to have cause to make you get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.24,0:29:02.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说闭嘴。别跟他说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I said shut up. You don't talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.51,0:29:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下车！下来！就这样。走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out! Out! That's right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.11,0:29:05.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-下车。  -好，听着，我下来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get out of the car.   -All right, look, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.38,0:29:06.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-快，转过身。  -我下来了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Go on, turn around.   -I'm out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.85,0:29:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-转过身。  -好，我下来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Turn around.   -Okay, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.11,0:29:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别碰他！  -哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Do not lay your hands on him!   -Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.55,0:29:10.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手放在我看得见的地方！下车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep your hands where I can see them! Get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.02,0:29:12.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下车！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.88,0:29:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，不，我们得做点什么。  -不，不，不，还不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, no, we got to do something.   -No, no, no, no, no, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.15,0:29:18.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才叫拍到好东西……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is how you know when you're getting good stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.12,0:29:19.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有意义的东西……在难的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stuff that matters... When it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.93,0:29:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂，你们不知道我是谁吗？哇，嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, look, you don't know who I am? Whoa, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是是是，我们不在乎你是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah, well, we don't care who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.03,0:29:25.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，等等。把手放到背后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ah, wait.   -Hands behind your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.90,0:29:28.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们不知道我是谁。听着。住手！他情况不对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't know who I am. Listen. Stop it! He's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.27,0:29:29.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要告你们。喂，你们看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna sue. Now, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.40,0:29:30.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我们没听过这话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think we haven't heard that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.00,0:29:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.94,0:29:34.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手！是他的背！——控制住嫌疑人！——小心！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Stop! It's his back!   -Control the suspect!   -Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.51,0:29:36.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，不，我现在就要叫停。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, I'm stopping this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.21,0:29:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，等等。瑞秋！瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, wait. Rachel! Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.08,0:29:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，我是瑞秋·戈德堡！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I'm Rachel Goldberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.58,0:29:42.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我报的警！别伤害他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the one who called! Don't hurt him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.28,0:29:43.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后！——别伤害他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Back up!   -Don't hurt him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.56,0:29:57.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}退后，退后！我说了退后！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Back up, back up! I said back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.56,0:29:59.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没武器！我手无寸铁！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm unarmed! I'm unarmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.10,0:30:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做了什么？！——出事的时候我赶过来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What did you do?!   -I came when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.47,0:30:04.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，我们在干什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, what are we doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.90,0:30:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.01,0:30:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他中枪了！能不能给他叫辆救护车？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's been shot! Can we get him an ambulance, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.61,0:30:13.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有脉搏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still have a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.55,0:30:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.02,0:30:26.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又是公司打来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The office again?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.29,0:30:28.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.90,0:30:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你每不接一次，就会更容易一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It gets easier every time you don't answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.50,0:30:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟你说了。这就是人生的秘诀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Told you. It's the secret to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.03,0:30:36.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}授权别人做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Delegate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.47,0:30:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.07,0:30:41.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，拜托，拜托，让它停下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please, please, make it stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.17,0:30:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请继续说那个下流的词。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep saying the dirty word, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.08,0:30:45.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}授权，授权，授权。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Delegate, delegate, delegate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.04,0:30:46.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。——我跟你说吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mm.   -I'll tell you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.58,0:30:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还能给你更好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll do you one better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.62,0:30:53.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.09,0:30:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么个更好法？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.59,0:31:00.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那真的非常非常下流。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is very, very dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.20,0:31:12.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，如果我们真要这么做，有件……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, if we're really gonna do this, there's, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.07,0:31:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事我得告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.60,0:31:15.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我见过最怪的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the weirdest person I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.98,0:31:20.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.48,0:31:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我觉得我可能爱上你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I feel I may be falling in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.65,0:31:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不敢相信我居然在说这种话……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I can't believe I'm saying this...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.32,0:31:29.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want children.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.56,0:31:31.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个以上，五个以下，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More than one, less than five,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.36,0:31:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们的孩子……我和我假设中的伴侣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but our children... Me and my hypothetical partner
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.36,0:31:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这件事上，理论上……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in this endeavor, who, theoretically,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.53,0:31:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能会是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}could end up being you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.37,0:31:45.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非这不在你的计划里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Unless that's something that's not in your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.11,0:31:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没想过我们之间会发生这种事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never expected this to happen between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.31,0:31:56.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没遇到过真正……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never meet anybody I actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.25,0:31:59.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.99,0:32:01.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me, neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.43,0:32:16.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警探，警探，那是我的员工。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Detective, detective, that's my employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.40,0:32:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戈德堡女士……法律上你不能跟她说话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ms. Goldberg... You are legally not allowed to talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.14,0:32:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有律师在场。你知道的，警探。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}without a lawyer present. You know that, detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.14,0:32:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会把你弄出去的。——我要跟戈德堡女士谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We'll get you out of here.   -I need to talk to Ms. Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.27,0:32:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在去转一圈，替我看看那些女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go around and check up on the girls for me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.18,0:32:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要她们别说任何有害的话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need them to not be saying anything that's harmful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.08,0:32:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我的错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.55,0:32:32.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我没跑出去，他就不会开枪打他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I hadn't run out, he wouldn't have shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.38,0:32:34.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我的错。你看那儿就知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's my fault. You can see it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.12,0:32:35.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就，快看一眼。——我知道了，我知道了。别说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Like, look really quickly.   -I got it, I got it. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.69,0:32:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是你的错。是警察的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not your fault. It's was the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.06,0:32:39.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的。——嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You know that.   -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.42,0:32:40.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是他们越界了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They were out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.63,0:32:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在就去处理他们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna handle them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.43,0:32:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只需要你去照顾好选手们，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just need you to go and take care of the contestants, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.06,0:32:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会照顾好你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.37,0:32:51.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.74,0:32:56.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.18,0:32:57.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警探，我们说到哪了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Detective, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.74,0:33:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那招还管用？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It still works?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.25,0:33:04.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我忘了提它会这样吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I forget to mention that it does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.49,0:33:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是电视台打来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, it's the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.59,0:33:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个你可不能授权别人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This one you can't delegate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.76,0:33:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好，加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:18.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在有点晚了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a little late to...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.73,0:33:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，慢点。慢点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, slow down. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.07,0:33:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}深呼吸，加里。呼吸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take a breath, Gary. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.24,0:33:28.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.61,0:33:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.24,0:33:33.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这很不幸。我同意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is unfortunate. I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.28,0:33:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科尔曼确实搞砸了，加里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Coleman certainly dropped the ball, Gary.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.48,0:33:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我马上就到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I will be there right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.32,0:33:41.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我会处理一切的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I will handle everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.12,0:33:42.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.42,0:33:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:48.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不是现在。——我不敢相信这事发生了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, not right now.   -I can't believe this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.49,0:33:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不该把车开走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They shouldn't have taken the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.50,0:33:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，什么……可他们就该无缘无故被拦下吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what... but they should have gotten pulled over for no reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.37,0:33:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋报了警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel called the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.84,0:34:00.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉她他们把车开走了，然后她……等等，你做了什么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told her they took the car, and she... Wait, what did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.54,0:34:03.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋报了警，然后跑到那儿去拍摄？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel called the police and then went out there to film it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.64,0:34:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的假的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.14,0:34:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我吃这种狗屎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I have eaten this crap
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.79,0:34:20.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃了这么久，那是我自己的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for so long now, and that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.53,0:34:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你这套说教、道貌岸然的狗屁……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you, with your preachy, holier-than-thou bullshit...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.53,0:34:26.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先，你为自己邀功\N{\rEN\blur0.8}First, you pat yourself on the black
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.30,0:34:28.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你找来了黑人男嘉宾，还有那些被\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for getting a black suitor and contestants who get
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.57,0:34:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当垃圾一样对待的选手，而现在你的计划是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}treated like garbage, and now your plan is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.70,0:34:32.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后呢，Rachel，就为了揭露\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to, what, Rachel, just expose
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.40,0:34:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警察有多种族歧视，就让一个黑人兄弟中枪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}how racist the police are by getting a brother shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.67,0:34:39.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果Romeo死了，这全是你的责任。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If Romeo dies, this is all on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.68,0:34:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且这故事轮不到你来讲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is not your story to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.71,0:34:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你别再想着帮忙了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So why don't you stop trying to help
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.28,0:34:47.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为很有可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because there's a very good chance
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:50.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有你，大家都会过得更好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}everyone might be better off without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.52,0:34:54.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.87,0:35:05.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Rachel。  -Rachel。- 我要见Darius。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rachel.   -Rachel.   -I want to see Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.60,0:35:08.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，发生什么了？警察怎么说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, what happened? What did the officers say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.31,0:35:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太可怕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.31,0:35:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这完全扯到另一码事上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is going off on another tangent all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.31,0:35:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我现在没空。  -你知道我们在哪儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I can't right now.   -Do you know where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.88,0:35:15.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Rachel？  -Rachel，你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rachel?   -Rachel, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.35,0:35:21.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.67,0:35:36.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.20,0:35:38.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.34,0:35:39.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，Chet打电话给我，说了发生的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Chet called. He told me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.94,0:35:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，呃……嘿，听着，我……你能走吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you, uh... hey, look, I'm... Can you just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.21,0:35:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我为之前说的话道歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I'm sorry for what I said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.74,0:35:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……我不是……我是在发泄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just... I didn't... I was lashing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.91,0:35:50.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-所以我道歉。我……  -你能走吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So I'm sorry. I...   -Can you just please leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.38,0:35:53.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不会逃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm not running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.35,0:35:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来陪你的，让我帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here for you, so let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.46,0:36:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我知道我们爱过彼此，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I know we loved each other, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.39,0:36:02.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没停止过爱你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've never stopped loving...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.63,0:36:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哥们，你能别说了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, can you just stop, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.40,0:36:06.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们确实爱过彼此，可你走了，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We did love each other, and you left, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.53,0:36:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我现在在这儿了。曾经有那么一丁点希望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm here now. There was, like, this tiny, little window of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.24,0:36:11.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你本可以救我的，可你没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}where you could have, like, saved me, and you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.54,0:36:13.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我身体里的每一样东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now every single thing inside of me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.37,0:36:14.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都像个小小的黑洞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is just, like, this little black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.94,0:36:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里面已经死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's, like, dead inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.68,0:36:18.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.24,0:36:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道，但我现在在这儿了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that, but I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.25,0:36:22.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-求你，你能走吗？  -Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please, can you just go?   -Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.25,0:36:25.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太晚了！你能走吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's too late! Can you please go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.32,0:36:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.52,0:36:28.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能走吗？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you please just go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.31,0:37:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-RACHEL？  -妈？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-RACHEL?   -Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.39,0:37:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“到阳台来见我”？这条神秘短信是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Meet me on the balcony"? What's up with the mystery text?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.49,0:37:40.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想让你到阳台来见我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted you to meet me on the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.79,0:37:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好极了。听着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.49,0:37:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在真没空开什么秘密会议。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't really have time for secret meetings right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.53,0:37:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里面出了点状况，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a bit of a situation inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.86,0:37:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你可能没注意到。  -哦，状况？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-in case you haven't noticed.   -Oh, a situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.63,0:37:49.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你摊上的是本世纪最烂的烂摊子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, what you have is the shit show of the century.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.80,0:37:52.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对对对。我就离开一晚。你到底怎么想的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, right. I leave you for one night. What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.40,0:37:54.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，也许我想的是我给你拍到了最棒的素材\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, maybe that I got you the most amazing footage
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.01,0:37:58.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可能是这节目史上最重要的故事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of possibly the most important story this show has ever even...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.54,0:38:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我们的男嘉宾送进了医院。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You put our suitor in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.58,0:38:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你害Romeo中枪，还把我的豪宅\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got Romeo shot, and you filled my mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.11,0:38:05.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-塞满了警察和律师。  -你能不能消停会儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-with cops and lawyers.   -Would you give me a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.38,0:38:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这正是你马上就能得到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's exactly what you're getting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.95,0:38:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家吧，Coleman。你到头了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go home, Coleman. You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.45,0:38:09.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.69,0:38:11.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来你像是在说我完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It sounded like you told me I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.42,0:38:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可没这个权力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't really have that authority
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.86,0:38:14.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-因为我正好是……  -总制作人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-because I happen to be...   -The showrunner?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.73,0:38:16.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，不再是了。又是我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, not anymore. It's me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.70,0:38:18.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，其实一直都是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, actually, it kind of always was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.93,0:38:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们就承认这点吧，Gary不过是把它正式化了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's just admit that, but Gary just made it official.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.90,0:38:24.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不信你。  -是吗，那你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I don't believe you.   -Yeah, well, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.14,0:38:26.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不如用你的手机打给Gary\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you just call Gary from your phone
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.77,0:38:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你回家的车上？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in your car on your way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.64,0:38:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.61,0:38:36.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.05,0:38:41.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel的母亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.42,0:39:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，谢谢你能来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.15,0:39:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿，里面到底发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, what the hell happened in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.63,0:39:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只知道Romeo在离我五英尺的地方中枪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All I know is that Romeo was shot five feet from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.53,0:39:25.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我吓坏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.76,0:39:29.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说……这可是个真人秀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean... this is a reality show.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.90,0:39:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么会发生这种事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.04,0:39:35.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说了，你连一半都不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I said, you don't know the half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.17,0:39:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Jeremy，你就告诉我吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy, just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.48,0:39:39.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.02,0:39:47.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 望向窗外的黑暗 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Staring out to dark
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.65,0:39:53.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你的倒影也在回望 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Your reflection stares right on *
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.06,0:39:56.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 寻找着那些 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Searching for the ones
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.66,0:40:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我的爱人将随之前行的人 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* With whom my lover will move on *
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.80,0:40:07.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐起来，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit up, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.61,0:40:11.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.81,0:40:17.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.95,0:40:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把药吃了，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take the medicine, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.56,0:40:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样你才会好起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's how you get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.04,0:40:43.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我爱你，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I love you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.88,0:40:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 哦…… *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Ohhhhhhhh
